                                                class="text-muted mx-2">•</span> <i class="fa fa-map-marker"></i>
                                            Mountain View, CA</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <span class="job-badge badge-remote"><i class="fa fa-wifi"></i> Remote</span>
                                </div>
                                <p class="mt-2">We're looking for an experienced Full Stack Developer to join our team.
                                    You'll work on cutting-edge projects using React, Node.js, and cloud technologies.
                                </p>
                                <div class="mb-2">
                                    <span class="job-tag"><i class="fa fa-code"></i> React</span>
                                    <span class="job-tag"><i class="fa fa-node"></i> Node.js</span>
                                    <span class="job-tag"><i class="fa fa-database"></i> MongoDB</span>
                                    <span class="job-tag"><i class="fa fa-cloud"></i> AWS</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mt-3 flex-wrap">
                                    <div>
                                        <span class="salary-text"><i class="fa fa-usd"></i> $120k - $160k</span>
                                        <span class="text-muted mx-2">•</span>
                                        <span><i class="fa fa-briefcase"></i> Full-time</span>
                                        <span class="text-muted mx-2">•</span>
                                        <span><i class="fa fa-calendar"></i> Posted 2 days ago</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <a href="/apply?job=senior-fullstack" class="btn btn-apply"><i
