                                    </div>
                                    <span class="job-badge badge-remote"><i class="fa fa-wifi"></i> Remote</span>
                                </div>
                                <p class="mt-2">Build and maintain scalable data pipelines, work with big data
                                    technologies, and ensure data quality and reliability.</p>
                                <div class="mb-2">
                                    <span class="job-tag"><i class="fa fa-python"></i> Python</span>
                                    <span class="job-tag"><i class="fa fa-database"></i> SQL</span>
                                    <span class="job-tag"><i class="fa fa-apache"></i> Spark</span>
                                    <span class="job-tag"><i class="fa fa-cloud"></i> Airflow</span>
